      "release.summary": "What's new in 1.18.0",
      "release.1": "**Turn the map with two fingers.** A twist rotates the map to any angle, in both modes of the compass button, and the map stays where you left it while the GPS keeps updating your position.",
      "release.2": "**The compass button takes the map back.** While the map is turned by hand the button shows a rotate icon; one tap brings the direction of travel back to the top, and the next tap hands the map to the phone heading as before.",
      "release.3": "**The angle survives the rotation of the phone.** Turning the phone keeps the angle you chose instead of snapping the map back straight.",
